{
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "tfm2_custom_gojo": {
        "name": "Gojo",
        "skill": "Six Eyes active by default: 90% less CE, 1.5x normal technique cooldown recovery, 20% less kit damage. 100 CE; regenerates 3/s or 6/s out of champion combat. Eye strain caps at 250; exhausted eyes recover 20/s and restore at 50. Active strain recovers 4/s after 1.5s. Infinity: a 160 + 40% AP shield that cuts technique damage by 55% and basic attacks by 30% while it holds; .1 CE/s upkeep and .5 CE rebuild while eyes function. Remaining shield stays during pauses without refilling. Blue: .6 CE / 5 strain, .4s preparation; existing damage once and a .6s inward spiral. Maximum Blue: 1.2 CE / 70 strain, .9s preparation, 135% damage and one three-second orb after arrival, up to 140000 throw range with committed left/right curves. Maximum outputs require active Six Eyes and the eight-second Black Flash window.",
        "skill2": "Red: 1 CE / 7 strain, .4s preparation; existing direct hit and explosion. Returning Red uses the same damage budget, deferring its explosion and knockback by .8s at a warned, fixed impact point. Maximum Red: 2 CE / 80 strain, 1s preparation and 135% damage. Its direct collision with your maximum Blue orb (140000 targeting reach) forms Hollow Nuke: .8s fixed warning, 400 + 240% AP magic damage in 96000 radius. It consumes half current HP (rounded down), bypassing shields, and adds 75 strain after impact. Body blocking prevents fusion. RCT: 2 CE / 8 strain, heals 80 + 50% AP; unavailable with exhausted eyes. Spatial Step: .8 CE / 8 strain, legal visible route up to 32000. Black Flash: two champion-bound melee hits after Blue/Red within four seconds; +30 + 35% AP, -10 strain and +20% kit damage for eight seconds, refresh without stacking. Triggering strike is resolved before amplification. Six Eyes with Black Flash gives 96% ordinary kit damage.",
        "ult": "Unlimited Void requires Six Eyes. Every enemy inside is stunned for at least 1s when the domain opens. Quick: 96000 radius, .2s warning, .2s exposure and one 1s stun; 50 strain. Full: 64000 radius, .75s warning that slows enemies inside by 40%, then a 4s maintained seal; 80 strain. Both cost 4 CE and share 60s base cooldown (40s with Six Eyes). One nearest living ally is the fixed protected guest; every other caught ally is controlled like an enemy. Closure causes 3s Limitless burnout. Ordinary Purple requires eyes, ultimate learned and both Blue/Red ready: 3.4 CE / 30 strain, 200 + 160% AP. Without Six Eyes only melee, ordinary Blue/Red and Spatial Step remain at full CE cost and normal cooldown recovery. Numeric rules and whirlpool/nuke behavior are gameplay adaptations; no mastery ranks."
      }
    }
  }
}
